8	      "note": "The tautological family over Z_beta is the pullback of the universal curve from the confirmed ATT-0112/CLM-0112-8 scheme model; the six ordered sections arise by splitting the finite etale degree-six divisor over the ordering torsor, hence are pairwise disjoint. Existence of f_beta follows from the 2-Yoneda universal property of M_{6,6}; no Aut comparison, monomorphism, quasi-finiteness, or closed-immersion claim is needed or made.",
